# The app baseline: what each checked program does, derived and accepted (app-baseline-design.md)
!**/.crow/baseline/
!**/.crow/baseline/**
# The app's book, derived by `crow book` on every start, and the pid files
# `crow run` and `crow book` keep while they serve
**/.crow/book/
**/.crow/*.pid

